---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FieldLabel from '../../components/FieldLabel.astro';
import BracketButton from '../../components/BracketButton.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import NavBar from '../../components/NavBar.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Services | FabricatorStudio"
  description="Rigging and pipeline services from the technical artist behind Fabricator: audits, rig and export setup, custom tools, and retainers."
>
  <NavBar />

  <section class="services-intro">
    <h1 class="vt">Services</h1>
    <p class="prose">The toolset is free. The person behind it is for hire. Every engagement is delivered by the technical artist who built Fabricator, not a team you have never met. Scope and pricing depend on your team, your characters, and your deadline, so everything below is quoted after a short discovery call.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="services-lead">
    <FieldLabel text="The Lead Offer" />
    <div class="service service--lead">
      <h3>Pipeline Health Audit</h3>
      <p>About a week. I review your rigs, skinning, export path, naming, and versioning, and you get a findings document, a prioritized fix list, and a quote for the fixes. If you sign a fix package within thirty days, the audit fee credits toward it in full.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-packages">
    <FieldLabel text="Fixed-Scope Packages" />
    <div class="services__grid">
      <div class="service">
        <h3>Export Contract Fix</h3>
        <p>Two to three days. One named character exporting clean into Unreal, end to end. The outcome-shaped opener for teams that already know their pain.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service">
        <h3>Character Rig and Export Setup</h3>
        <p>Hero characters rigged with Fabricator and wired into your Maya-to-Unreal export contract. Scoped by roster size.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service">
        <h3>Custom Tool Sprint</h3>
        <p>One scoped Maya tool built to spec, two to three weeks, documentation included.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-retainers">
    <FieldLabel text="Ongoing" />
    <h2 class="subhead">Retainers</h2>
    <p class="prose">Monthly retainers cover fixes, questions, tool patches, and pipeline ownership at whatever cadence your production needs, from a couple of days a month to a fractional TA lead role. Embedded contract work and advisory calls are also available.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="services-process">
    <FieldLabel text="How It Works" />
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>A discovery call: your team, your characters, your pain points.</li>
      <li>A written scope with deliverables and a quote.</li>
      <li>Delivery in a focused burst, with everything documented.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="services-trust">
    <FieldLabel text="Trust" />
    <p class="prose">Everything FabricatorStudio ships is open source: transparent, verifiable code that runs local with zero telemetry. Your own people can read every line before anything touches your pipeline.</p>
    <p class="prose">Engagements work the same way: no black boxes. Every solution starts as a written proposal and is delivered transparent, open, and ready for you to verify. Readable code, documented, and fully yours to maintain.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="services-cta">
    <p class="prose">Tell me what is breaking and I will tell you what it takes to fix it.</p>
    <BracketButton kind="plasma-outline" label="Book a discovery call" href="mailto:adrianmelian123@gmail.com?subject=FabricatorStudio%20discovery%20call" />
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .services-intro { text-align: center; }
  .services-intro .prose { margin-inline: auto; text-align: left; margin-top: 1rem; }

  .services-lead { text-align: center; }
  .service--lead { margin-inline: auto; max-width: 36rem; text-align: left; }

  .services-packages { text-align: center; }
  .services__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem; margin: 2rem 0; text-align: left; }

  .service { border: 1px solid var(--iron-2); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--iron); padding: 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.625rem; }
  .service h3 { font-size: 1rem; }
  .service p { color: var(--bone-dim); font-size: 0.9375rem; }

  .services-retainers { text-align: center; }
  .services-retainers .prose { margin-inline: auto; text-align: left; margin-top: 1rem; }

  .services-process { text-align: center; }
  .steps {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--bone-dim);
  }
  .steps li { padding-left: 0.25rem; }

  .services-trust { text-align: center; }
  .services-trust .prose { margin-inline: auto; text-align: left; margin-top: 1rem; }

  .services-cta { text-align: center; }
  .services-cta .prose { margin-inline: auto; text-align: left; }
  .services-cta .btn { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
